      },
      "translations": {
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "Aufgrund ihrer künstlichen Natur diente sie als Modell für die ersten Automata-Prototypen der Fraktion.",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "Debido a su naturaleza artificial, sirvió de modelo para los primeros prototipos de autómata de Axiom.",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "Par sa nature artificielle, elle a servi de modèle pour les premiers prototypes d'automates de la Faction.",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "Per via della sua natura artificiale, funse da modella per i primi prototipi di automi della fazione.",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "en_US": {
          "text": "Because of her artificial nature, she served as a model for the Faction's first Automata prototypes.",
          "locale": "en_US"
        }
      },
      "id": "01HPME7WBWPA1XYDGYPNNVYJR0",
      "text": "Because of her artificial nature, she served as a model for the Faction's first Automata prototypes."
